---
// E-E-A-T trust block: why this guide exists, editorial team, sources, and a
// this-site vs competitor comparison. Author identity can be replaced with a real
// name, avatar, and playtime credentials.
---

<section id="trust" class="border-b border-stone-800/70 py-16 sm:py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-50 sm:text-4xl">
      Why Trust This Guide
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-stone-400">
      Most pages ranking for "Durin Genshin" are sprawling wiki entries, paywalled build
      guides, or top-up shops using leaked info to sell Primogems. We built this page to be the
      opposite: a single, complete, ad-free reference for one character only.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 overflow-x-auto">
      <table class="w-full min-w-[32rem] border-collapse text-sm">
        <thead>
          <tr class="text-left">
            <th class="py-3 pr-4 font-medium text-stone-500"></th>
            <th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-ember-400">This guide</th>
            <th class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-stone-300">Fandom / Game8</th>
            <th class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-stone-300">Top-up shops</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr class="border-b border-stone-800/70">
            <td class="py-4 pr-4 text-stone-400">Focus</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-stone-100">Durin only</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-stone-300">One page in a huge roster</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-stone-300">Sales funnel</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-stone-800/70">
            <td class="py-4 pr-4 text-stone-400">Both forms covered</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-stone-100">Yes (White Flame + Dark Decay)</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-stone-300">Often only one</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-stone-300">No</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-stone-800/70">
            <td class="py-4 pr-4 text-stone-400">Paywall / login</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-stone-100">None</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-stone-300">Game8 gates content</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-stone-300">Checkout prompts</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-stone-800/70">
            <td class="py-4 pr-4 text-stone-400">Ads / top-up links</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-stone-100">None</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-stone-300">Heavy ads</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-stone-300">Everywhere</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="py-4 pr-4 text-stone-400">Update cadence</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-stone-100">Every version</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-stone-300">Irregular</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-stone-300">Stale after launch</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-stone-800 bg-stone-900/40 p-6 sm:p-8">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
        <div
          class="flex h-14 w-14 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-ember-700/50 bg-ember-950/40 text-lg font-bold text-ember-400"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          D
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1">
          <p class="text-base font-semibold text-stone-100">Durin Genshin Guide Editorial Team</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-stone-400">
            Maintained by Genshin Impact players who track Mondstadt characters, two-form Pyro
            supports, and the Dragonspine lore line. Build recommendations follow official
            skill descriptions and community testing, and are updated as new versions land.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-left text-xs leading-relaxed text-stone-500 sm:text-right">
          <p>
            Sources:
            <a
              href="https://genshin.hoyoverse.com/"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener"
              class="text-stone-400 underline decoration-stone-700 underline-offset-2 transition-colors hover:text-ember-400"
            >
              HoYoverse
            </a>,
            <a
              href="https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Durin"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener"
              class="text-stone-400 underline decoration-stone-700 underline-offset-2 transition-colors hover:text-ember-400"
            >
              community wikis
            </a>,
            in-game quest text.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-1">Last updated: August 25, 2026</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
